      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1788288884469,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "We'll leave Swap, OOM Killer, Docker memory limits, and Kubernetes memory limits \nfor the next part so we can go deeper.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
